# Ashenvale (Horde) - Rares & Treasures (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# The Horde companion to ashenvale-horde.guide: every rare-flagged NPC spawning
# on map 1440 the data supports for Horde, the four core item-start hunts, and
# the zone's fixed containers. All goals optional; no accept/turnin lines.
# Levels 19-30 (the Horde core band). Inventoried in
# docs/ashenvale-horde-companions-inventory.md.
guide butler-routes-completionist/ashenvale-horde-rares
title Ashenvale (Horde) - Rares & Treasures
levels 19-30
zone Ashenvale
faction Horde
category Collectibles
folder Companions
coords live
version 1
keywords vespia,mist howler,mugglefin,rorgish,snapper,terrowulf,akkrilus,ursangous,tideress,shadumbra,oakpaw,eckalom,sharptalon,raze,ursol,treasure,chest,hunt

step Northwest shore - Lady Vespia
  zone map 1440
  loop
    goto 9.87,14.34 map 1440
    goto 13.63,24.73 map 1440
  kill 10559 optional -- Lady Vespia, along the northwest shore
  note She walks the shoreline rocks - check both points. Respawn timer unconfirmed.
  collect 284704 optional -- Frostbitten Staff off Lady Vespia, an Ashenvale-exclusive drop
  note The Ring of Zoram also drops here but drops on Darkshore too - no goal for it.

step Northwest woods - Mist Howler
  zone map 1440
  loop
    goto 20.93,36.92 map 1440
    goto 26.8,18.35 map 1440
  kill 10644 optional -- Mist Howler, in the northwest woods
  note He ranges between the two points. Respawn timer unconfirmed.
  collect 284666 optional -- Wolf Whistle off Mist Howler, an Ashenvale-exclusive drop

step West - Mugglefin
  zone map 1440
  goto 19.38,42.73 map 1440
  kill 10643 optional -- Mugglefin, west of the forest heart
  note A lone murloc Oracle with ordinary murloc loot. Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step North-center - Rorgish Jowl
  zone map 1440
  goto 35.82,36.61 map 1440
  kill 10639 optional -- Rorgish Jowl, north of the center
  note A lone elite furbolg. Respawn timer unconfirmed.
  collect 284700 optional -- Den Guardian's Crusher off Rorgish Jowl, an Ashenvale-exclusive drop

step Center - Branch Snapper
  zone map 1440
  goto 46.51,44.27 map 1440
  kill 10641 optional -- Branch Snapper, near the center
  note Ordinary snapper loot - nothing exclusive confirmed. Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Center-east - Terrowulf Packlord
  zone map 1440
  goto 49.77,39.61 map 1440
  note The Packlord is level 32, just above this guide's band - come back in a level or two if he outmatches you.
  kill 3792 optional -- Terrowulf Packlord, east of center
  note A lone elite wolf. Respawn timer unconfirmed.
  collect 5753 optional -- Ruffled Chaplet off the Terrowulf Packlord, an Ashenvale-exclusive drop
  collect 5754 optional -- Wolfpack Medallion off the Terrowulf Packlord, an Ashenvale-exclusive drop

step Southwest - Akkrilus
  zone map 1440
  goto 25.62,63.54 map 1440
  kill 3773 optional -- Akkrilus, in the southwest
  note A satyr with only Shredder Manual pages on him - nothing exclusive confirmed. Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Thistlefur country - Ursangous's hunt
  zone map 1440
  goto 39.76,65.21 map 1440
  kill 12678 optional -- Ursangous, west of Fallen Sky Lake
  note Ursangous is not rare-flagged - he is hunted for the core guide's quest, not for himself.
  collect 16303 optional -- Ursangous's Paw off Ursangous, the 100% drop
  note The Paw starts quest 23 (Ursangous's Paw) in the core guide ashenvale-horde.guide - the accept and turn-in live there.

step Mystral Lake - Tideress's hunt
  zone map 1440
  goto 46.0,70.0 map 1440
  kill 12759 optional -- Tideress, in Mystral Lake
  note Tideress is not rare-flagged - she is hunted for the core guide's quest, not for herself.
  collect 16408 optional -- Befouled Water Globe off Tideress, the 100% drop
  note The Globe starts quest 1918 (The Befouled Element) in the core guide ashenvale-horde.guide - the accept and turn-in live there. Her Intact Elemental Bracer feeds only an Alliance quest - no goal for it.

step South-center - Shadumbra's hunt
  zone map 1440
  goto 57.5,56.05 map 1440
  kill 12677 optional -- Shadumbra, south of the center
  note Shadumbra is not rare-flagged - she is hunted for the core guide's quest, not for herself.
  collect 16304 optional -- Shadumbra's Head off Shadumbra, the 100% drop
  note The Head starts quest 24 (Shadumbra's Head) in the core guide ashenvale-horde.guide - the accept and turn-in live there.

step Southeast - Oakpaw
  zone map 1440
  goto 56.01,62.75 map 1440
  kill 10640 optional -- Oakpaw, southeast of center
  note A bear with only Shredder Manual pages on him - nothing exclusive confirmed. Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Southeast - Eck'alom
  zone map 1440
  goto 52.76,70.05 map 1440
  kill 10642 optional -- Eck'alom, in the southeast
  note His Broken, Damaged, Fractured and Crushed Elemental Bracers are Ashenvale-exclusive but feed only the Alliance quest Elemental Bracers (q1016) - loot or vendor them; no goal ships for unusable quest items. Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step East - Sharptalon's hunt
  zone map 1440
  goto 74.98,70.06 map 1440
  kill 12676 optional -- Sharptalon, in the east
  note Sharptalon is not rare-flagged - he is hunted for the core guide's quest, not for himself.
  collect 16305 optional -- Sharptalon's Claw off Sharptalon, the 100% drop
  note The Claw starts quest 2 (Sharptalon's Claw) in the core guide ashenvale-horde.guide - the accept and turn-in live there.

step Far east - Prince Raze
  zone map 1440
  loop
    goto 78.08,46.35 map 1440
    goto 81.56,48.51 map 1440
  note Prince Raze is level 32, just above this guide's band - come back in a level or two if he outmatches you.
  kill 10647 optional -- Prince Raze, at the far-east edge
  note A naga prince ranging between the two points. Respawn timer unconfirmed.
  collect 284697 optional -- Arcane Charged Robes off Prince Raze, an Ashenvale-exclusive drop
  note Prince Raze also drops Satyr Horns, but only while on a horns quest - collect them while holding quest 6441 (Satyr Horns) from the core guide ashenvale-horde.guide and hand them to Pixel there.

step Far-east edge - Ursol'lok
  zone map 1440
  goto 83.37,48.51 map 1440
  note Ursol'lok is level 31, just above this guide's band - come back in a level or two if he outmatches you.
  kill 12037 optional -- Ursol'lok, at the far-east edge
  note A lone elite bear. Respawn timer unconfirmed.
  collect 284573 optional -- Ursol'lok's Paws off Ursol'lok, an Ashenvale-exclusive drop
  task "Tame it instead of killing it" optional only Hunter

